chibi-scheme (0.9.1-4) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Drop d/libchibi-scheme-ffi.lintian-overrides:
    - It contained two overrides, one was an alien tag and the other was
      unused.
  * debian/control:
    - Fix binNMU-unsafe dependency (chibi-scheme-images -> chibi-scheme).
    - Bump Standards-Version to 4.7.4
    - Remove `Priority: optional`: this is the default now
    - Remove `Rules-Requires-Root: no`: this is the default now
  * debian/watch: Upgrade to version 5

